OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackle blaze at Glasgow
OL,4,Arecycling centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews have responded to a blaze at
OL,7,Fa recycling facility in Glasgow.
OL,9,FThree appliances and a high reach
OL,10,Fvehicle were dispatched to Shieldhall
OL,11,FRecycling Centre on Bogmoor Road.
OL,13,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,14,Fsaid they were called to the scene at
OL,15,Fabout 10:36 on Saturday.
OL,17,FThey have encouraged local residents
OL,18,Fand those not in the immediate area who
OL,19,Fcan either see or smell smoke to keep
OL,20,Ftheir windows and doors closed.
